/* Codex connection help */
"Connect Codex" = "连接 Codex";
"The hook is installed. Codex blocks unknown command hooks until you trust them once , a Codex security feature, not an LuMate bug. Do this one time:" = "回调已安装。Codex 会拦截未知的命令回调，直到你信任一次 , 这是 Codex 的安全机制，并非 LuMate · 噜伴 的问题。只需操作一次：";
